🛗 "Regretiware" 🛗
- Xeno and Solara are not supported! ⚠️

Regretiware is a script made specifically for a roguelike game - Regretevator, it is focused on actually working across majority of floors instead of having a short list of functions like other Regretevator scripts do, Regretiware is actually the best script for Regretevator you'll find since it's the first and only one to support 95% of floors.

Regretiware is currently in BETA, meaning that there is a lot of features coming, expect some bugs since due to complexity of the script it is hard to keep everything running perfectly smooth, we are constantly working on improving the script and making it compatible with more executors.

- Why regretiware? ❓
Supports 95%+ of Regretevator floors;
User Friendly UI;
High quality unique features that none other script has;
Anticheat bypass so you don't get banned;
(and alot more)

For full compatibility with current Regretiware build we recommend you to use Potassium or Volt.
